{
    "title": "Gallery - Photo Gallery, Album",
    "description": "Galleryit is a FREE photo gallery for all Android devices.\r\n\r\nYou can easily view, organize, and edit your photos and videos with it.\r\n\r\nDownload this photo manager and manage your files anytime, anywhere without the internet!\r\n\r\nKEY FEATURES OF GALLERYIT\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf04 All-in-one photo gallery\r\nWith Galleryit, you can easily view files in all formats: JPEG, GIF, PNG, Panorama, MP4, MKV, RAW, etc. It also supports playing photos as a slideshow, allowing customizing slideshow intervals.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd12 Secure photo & video locker\r\nHave a photo or video you don't want others to see? Lock your private photos, videos, files, and folders with this most secure gallery lock! Securely manage your secret files and photo storage with PIN/pattern/fingerprint, and keep your privacy 100% safe with military-grade encryption.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\uddd1\ufe0f Deleted photos and videos recovery\r\nAccidentally deleted your precious moments? Don't worry, any deleted files will be auto moved to trash and can be quickly recovered! You can also choose to directly delete files permanently to help you save memory.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd0d Fast & powerful file searching\r\n* Smart classification: categorize files by time, location, and file type.\r\n* Quick search: filter files by date taken, name, file size, and last modified time to quickly find your target.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\uddc2\ufe0f Easy file management\r\n* Create folders to manage and organize your photos and videos.\r\n* Share with others via email, message, and various social media.\r\n* Customize your home screen/lock screen with your preferred picture.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcbc Uninstall protection\r\nGalleryit uses device administrator permission to prevent accidental uninstallation by strangers, children, or other cleaning apps. This will protect your photos and videos from being lost.\r\n\r\nUPCOMING FEATURES\r\n\ud83c\udf1fFile cleaner - quickly detect duplicate photos/large videos/screenshots and intelligently clear useless data for you.\r\n\ud83c\udf1fPicture/video compression - multiple compression sizes and resolutions are available to choose, which greatly saves your device\u2019s memory.\r\n\ud83c\udf1fMore editing features: add text, stickers, selfie editor, etc.\r\n\r\n* For Android 11 users, \"All Files Access\" permission is required to ensure the features such as file encryption and management can work properly.\r\n\r\nWe are committed to providing a better user experience. If you have any questions or suggestions, please feel free to contact us: galleryitfeedback@gmail.com\r\n\r\nPrivate Photo Vault & Photo Storage\r\nProtect photo album and hide pictures with a PIN code. This private photo vault creates the safest place for sensitive files. With this photo lock app, you can share your phone without revealing your privacy.\r\n\r\nGallery vault allows you to hide pictures with PIN/pattern/fingerprint. Galleryit is an absolutely safe photo lock app, your trustworthy private photo vault, and photo storage solution! It's also a photo manager for creating different kinds of photo album.\r\n\r\nPhoto Gallery App\r\nGalleryit is a great photo gallery app with editing tools for Android. With it, you have photo lock app, photo manager and gallery vault all at the same time. Never miss this awesome photo gallery app for Android.\r\n\r\nGalleryit, the most brilliant gallery app for Android. A gallery vault to hide pictures and photo album; support viewing or editing photos in multiple formats and restoring photos and videos easily. Come and try it!",
